WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.860
Every great journey begins with a little beginning.

2
00:00:04.483 --> 00:00:11.043
At Dr. VedPati Mishra Institute Of Scholars, we believe every child holds a world of possibility.

3
00:00:11.683 --> 00:00:18.983
In the Early Years, Nursery, Prep, LKG and UKG, children learn through play, stories, music and wonder.

4
00:00:19.616 --> 00:00:25.316
From Class One to Five, strong foundations grow into confident reading, writing and thinking.

5
00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:32.210
And from Class Six to Eight, curiosity becomes understanding, through concepts, projects and inquiry.

6
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.740
A CBSE-oriented journey, built on understanding, not memorising.

7
00:00:38.383 --> 00:00:41.653
Admissions are now open, from Nursery to Class Eight.

8
00:00:42.283 --> 00:00:46.983
VMIS, Handia, Prayagraj. Begin your child's journey today.
